  "body": "Having implemented a Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy-Report-Only policy on my site, I've noticed that I'm getting reports of types \"navigation-from-response\" and \"navigation-to-response\". From what I can tell from [the spec](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/dev/origin.html#reporting), these occur when navigating to or away from a page with COOP applied.\r\n\r\nWhat action do I, as a web developer, need to take upon receiving these? Stop letting people navigating to or from my site? If there's no action required, why are they being sent in the first place?",
